Z||000001||FieroLisa||05-10-2001||04:53 PM||||You can go to the link that says Pennocks Image Poster on the bottom of the page, but for some people, including me, it doesn't work. So as long as you have a webpage with someone other than geocities you can use this to show pics that are uploaded on your site (minus the asterisks so the code will show)<BR> [*img*]http://www.mywebpage.com/fieropic.jpg[*/img*]<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/daytona1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by FieroLisa (edited 05-10-2001).]||||reg||1
